{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "35466da2-2db1-5f12-ba7e-adc8115ac05e", "source_ordinal": 4203, "reading_ordinal": 4144, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "川蜀", "published_at": "2026-08-11T12:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2046216394774258497/answer/2047642372377522704"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "恰恰是因为“蜀”被蜀汉用了，带上了拆解不掉的时代属性，为了避免歧义，“蜀”字就无法再用。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一个很简单的例证——", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 55}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "蜀人和川人是不是同一批人？蜀军和川军是不是同一支部队？", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "蜀人特指蜀汉臣民，蜀军特指蜀汉的军队，这种固化已经在古代文献中被构建完成，这就反而导致蜀字不可用。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这就和陕西没法用“秦”字是一样的道理。秦人、秦军的时代性含义太强，遍布各种文献文书，已经是高频而难以更改的固定概念。在后代沿用秦的称谓，会引起大量时空认知上的混乱。", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "只要没有这个时空冲突的场合，秦和蜀就照用不误——譬如秦腔、蜀锦。因为并没有一个需要区分的陕腔、川锦存在，指向的仍然确实是同一个事物。同样的道理，“秦地”“蜀地”也仍然常用，也是因为就地块而言，这两个概念的现代指向和古代没有什么区别。", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 333}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "相对没那么出风头的晋、鲁就没能获得这种特殊区别对待——ta们缺少那个必须被绕行的重要文化地位。", "char_start": 334, "char_end": 381}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这其实是实用主义的现实应用，谈到“怕当地人抱团独立”的地步就有些过了。", "char_start": 382, "char_end": 417}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0589"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：四川的简称为什么不用“蜀”？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“川蜀”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“恰恰是因为“蜀”被蜀汉用了，带上了拆解不掉的时代属性，为了避免歧义，“蜀”字就无法再用。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "恰恰是因为“蜀”被蜀汉用了，带上了拆解不掉的时代属性，为了避免歧义，“蜀”字就无法再用。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 44, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "753593ca-9bf8-5e20-9713-d7579f65c0a4", "source_ordinal": 4202, "reading_ordinal": 4145, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "打个颠倒", "published_at": "2026-08-12T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/c23560fc904011f18b0652540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "我这么说吧——给你旁观者视角的真相：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "A）小孩子进退有据，行止有度，少年老成，父母怡然自若——嗯，看来家庭教育有一套，父母想必能力超群。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "B）小孩子缺少礼数，大呼小叫，父母连连道歉——唉，看来这孩子天性跳脱，父母怕是要辛苦了。", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 113}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "C）孩子上蹿下跳，父母视若无睹，毫无歉意——看来这是有其父必有其子，全家都没有礼数的概念。", "char_start": 114, "char_end": 159}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "D）孩子上蹿下跳，父母当面呵斥，一边赔笑道歉，一边当面许诺回家一定胖揍一顿——这厮无能之辈，无力教导倒也罢了，关键是搞不清教导责任在自己身上，还下意识卖子求荣；不但卖子求荣，还假设我是心胸狭隘之人，必须要看到孩子挨打才能消气。", "char_start": 160, "char_end": 273}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "E）孩子上蹿下跳，父母无力控制便罢了，显然已经动怒，但因为当我面不想家丑外扬，只好用利诱哄骗争取配合，而一边利诱，一边威胁“再不听话回家你等着”——这人教育子女黔驴技穷，其实已经完全丧失权威，开始被子女拿捏，对外勉强装体面，而且只剩下暴力手段。", "char_start": 274, "char_end": 396}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "实话对你说，真遇到这样的情况，单就维护你在外人眼里的形象而论，你最好的选择是站起来向主家道歉，告辞，直接带孩子回家，另约时间不带孩子再来。", "char_start": 397, "char_end": 466}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你不必在当场对孩子有任何处置，纯终止访问回家就行了。", "char_start": 467, "char_end": 493}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "小孩子的确社会化不足，这是天性，你一时没有评估好，错误的认为ta可以遵守社交礼仪，这没什么大不了的，因为这是诚实的错误。谁要是觉得自己能百分百教养好自己的幼年孩子，那只会是一种不知人间疾苦的傲慢而已。", "char_start": 494, "char_end": 594}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这就像你感冒了、摔倒了，是有问题，但没人真的可以因此责怪你、看不起你一样，你根本没有丢什么脸，这样就嘲笑你的人，自己才丢脸。", "char_start": 595, "char_end": 657}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "结果你来为此感到羞愧难当，你什么意思？你的意思是子女乖顺应该是普遍平均水平、谁做不到谁就是傻x吗？", "char_start": 658, "char_end": 707}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你在用羞耻羞辱所有人。", "char_start": 708, "char_end": 719}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你先羞辱完所有人，然后再展示一轮黔驴技穷、色厉内荏，你觉得这是个正确的行为吗？", "char_start": 720, "char_end": 759}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "我说实话，你这个上蹿下跳的娃远没有你丢你家的脸多。", "char_start": 760, "char_end": 785}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "差着一两个数量级。", "char_start": 786, "char_end": 795}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "不是ta的糟糕表现连累了你，而是你的糟糕表现将来要连累ta，你懂不懂？", "char_start": 796, "char_end": 831}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "人看不起你，不是因为你的子女怎么没表现好，而是因为你对“子女没表现好”这件事的表现本身不好。", "char_start": 832, "char_end": 878}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "人看不起ta，不看好ta，也不是因为ta自身表现有多不好，而是因为ta的父母表现得太差，以至于人不能不对ta的前途感到悲观。", "char_start": 879, "char_end": 941}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "按谁连累了谁来论，应该是ta回家胖揍你一顿才对，你还胖揍ta？", "char_start": 942, "char_end": 973}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "是你要搞清楚到底什么是丢脸、什么是长脸。", "char_start": 974, "char_end": 994}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你自己才是需要补课在先的那一个。", "char_start": 995, "char_end": 1011}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 25}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0589"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：孩子在亲戚家特别不乖，不断吵闹，作，碍于面子没发火，回家后要不要好好教训一顿？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“打个颠倒”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“我这么说吧——给你旁观者视角的真相：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "我这么说吧——给你旁观者视角的真相：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0c28890b-63ff-500b-9bf4-a7123264a7a8", "source_ordinal": 4200, "reading_ordinal": 4146, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "无遮", "published_at": "2026-08-12T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/29667154/answer/2048044077443294643"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "因为人类的生殖器几乎可以说存在设计缺陷。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你去看牛马猫犬，会发现除了外露的睾丸部分，除了发情状态外，它们的外生殖器几乎都是完全内缩或被专有组织严密的遮蔽固定的。远不像人类的自然状态这样突出和无约束。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 99}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这可能是因为人类群落作为顶级掠食者过于安全所致，但无论如何这种设计对于奔跑、穿越、搏斗、乃至简单的坐姿都有巨大的现实妨碍。", "char_start": 100, "char_end": 161}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "都别说让你找个野地不穿裤子来个百米冲刺或者穿越灌木丛、蹚过河流了，就只说让你在野外找个地方坐坐，不穿裤子我看你敢坐哪。", "char_start": 162, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "坐树桩子上，还是坐石头上，还是坐草皮上？", "char_start": 222, "char_end": 242}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "给蚂蚁们加餐么？", "char_start": 243, "char_end": 251}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你当大猩猩为啥只有三厘米长？", "char_start": 252, "char_end": 266}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "哪里是因为它用不着？就是纯基因变异也会有几个大的。", "char_start": 267, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "也不是因为怕打架——就是不穿裤子，狮子全家一起上也打不过成群的大猩猩。", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 328}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "它也不需要跟人赛跑。", "char_start": 329, "char_end": 339}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "它纯粹是没法一辈子站着听课。", "char_start": 340, "char_end": 354}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "没法坐的生活是个啥滋味？", "char_start": 355, "char_end": 367}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你也是这个专业的，你掂量掂量。", "char_start": 368, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这一共就这么几个办法——", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 396}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "光着，想大，那就学牛马大象一辈子站着；", "char_start": 397, "char_end": 416}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "光着，想坐，那就学狮子老虎大猩猩小巧点，要么就自己长出一个鞘体结构来保护起来——这就是自己长了条内裤。", "char_start": 417, "char_end": 468}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "要么就只剩两条路，要么背着把凳子走天涯，要么自己找块皮子或者布包起来。", "char_start": 469, "char_end": 504}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这不是为了什么“怕异性发情”。", "char_start": 505, "char_end": 520}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "首先，这种担忧纯属无稽之谈。", "char_start": 521, "char_end": 535}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "何以见得？", "char_start": 536, "char_end": 541}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "因为衣服的起源大约距今8.5-17万年，是非洲智人时代的事。为啥推算17万年前智人就开始穿衣服？因为这个时期已经发现了体虱和头虱的分化，而一般认为体虱是必须依赖贴身衣物才能存活的寄生虫。", "char_start": 542, "char_end": 635}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "而语言的起源却是5-15万年的事——这是喉部解剖结构分析得出的客观结论。5万年的判断从何而来？因为这个时期洞穴岩画才开始在非洲区域出现。这时候还谈不上文字。如果没有符号体系支撑、纯靠语音手势交流，能传递的概念是极为浅薄而具象的。", "char_start": 636, "char_end": 750}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你说个狮子犀牛还罢了，你要说个“羞耻”——这么说吧，现代汉语还对何所谓羞耻、为何要羞耻吵破头，你让连文字都没发明出来、喉咙都还没演化到能超过猩猩多少的南方智人靠咿咿啊啊和比划说出一句“你没穿衣服不羞耻吗”，难度堪比逼着没学会数字的人解方程。", "char_start": 751, "char_end": 871}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "别说“羞耻”这么高级的概念，“父亲”这个概念在人类知道穿兽皮的时代都还没出现。", "char_start": 872, "char_end": 911}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "“羞耻”感从何而来？", "char_start": 912, "char_end": 922}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "至于“避免刺激异性发情”一说——这么说吧，如果这真不利于种群利益，演化根本不会给人类开这种四季性活跃的绿灯。只要演化机制允许动物进入性活跃期，就没有一种在自然生活中的物种会自己去限制性行为。", "char_start": 923, "char_end": 1018}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "绝对的应生尽生。", "char_start": 1019, "char_end": 1027}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "发情与否和生殖器暴露与否根本无关，那是特殊的信号——特殊的姿态、气味、表情触发的反应。", "char_start": 1029, "char_end": 1072}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "两只猫连面都见不到，光凭叫声就已经互相激发了。", "char_start": 1073, "char_end": 1096}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "然而如果没有这些动作、气味做信号，雄兽看到没穿裤子的雌兽是绕着走的，因为一来人家根本没排卵，你在这纯白忙活；二来你这时候往前逼近，更容易被认定为夺食、抢地盘和杀幼崽，而不是要来谈恋爱，更容易挨大巴掌、拉大血口子。", "char_start": 1097, "char_end": 1203}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "要真成对发情而且赢得了交配权了，只要一个眼神不对，别说一块皮子一块布，就是钨钢战甲都给你砸开你信不。", "char_start": 1204, "char_end": 1254}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "甚至这时候雌性一方自己还嫌碍事呢。", "char_start": 1255, "char_end": 1272}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "动物界发情的普遍规律是雄性只是变得暴躁而痛觉钝感，雌性才是忍受剧烈痛苦的一方。", "char_start": 1273, "char_end": 1312}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "雄性是吃饱了不睡觉想找茬打架，雌性才是生不如死只求哪位好汉索性来结果了朕的性命——否则为什么这时食也不护了、地盘也不要了？", "char_start": 1313, "char_end": 1374}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "同样的，人类性唤起与否，和是否遮盖关键部位根本没关系，几乎完全取决于女性是否进入了新生育期。", "char_start": 1375, "char_end": 1421}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "一旦出了生育期，不管是大着肚子还是显著的瘦弱，就是不穿也不怎么会引发男性的欲望。", "char_start": 1422, "char_end": 1462}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "其实不穿上衣的部落世界上还多得是，甚至短短几十年前朝韩女性都不穿。你自己找点资料看看，不在生育期间的未穿上衣的女性你是不是看了就会按捺不住。", "char_start": 1463, "char_end": 1533}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "恐怕更大概率是原本按捺不住，看了反而坐下了。", "char_start": 1534, "char_end": 1556}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "所以如果穿衣是由“压制性冲动”这种理由驱动，那么对育龄人类这纯属逆天而行，而对非育龄人类又纯属多余。", "char_start": 1557, "char_end": 1607}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "话说到这个份上，结论已经极其清晰了——人类学会穿裤子纯属实用理由。", "char_start": 1608, "char_end": 1641}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "是为了在连话都说不清、谁是俺爹都分不清的时代保护脆弱的生殖系统和保暖。", "char_start": 1642, "char_end": 1677}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "谁不服，谁蹲一辈子、冻一辈子好了。", "char_start": 1678, "char_end": 1695}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "人类穿上围腰时，根本不是为了“遮”，而是了“挡”。", "char_start": 1696, "char_end": 1721}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "至于说给衣服加上各种文化属性、用作社会关系的调节工具，那是一种附加运用，是一种借机行事。", "char_start": 1722, "char_end": 1766}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "不要搞得本末倒置了。", "char_start": 1767, "char_end": 1777}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "这么说吧——你就是和梦中情人孤男寡女坠机流落荒岛了，你还是会惦记着穿上裤子的。", "char_start": 1778, "char_end": 1817}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "这就是结论，散会。", "char_start": 1818, "char_end": 1827}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 48}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0589"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么人类会想到要遮挡生殖器？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047"], "summary": "围绕“无遮”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“因为人类的生殖器几乎可以说存在设计缺陷。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "因为人类的生殖器几乎可以说存在设计缺陷。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "3e4a41df-16a0-5b80-beeb-19ee08fe7329", "source_ordinal": 4201, "reading_ordinal": 4147, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "白菜救世", "published_at": "2026-08-12T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2040009302925105031/answer/2048070718513063398"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "因为老天爷不忍心世界上只有那么点人能穿得起鞋子、用得上空调、开的起车、用得起电、吃得起饭和药啊。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 48}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "中国企业进入一个行业，大头从来就不是“原本赚大钱的中国人现在赚小钱”，而是“原本在家没钱赚的中国人现在好歹有小钱赚了”。", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 109}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "生产线上挤满的并不是沦落凡间的天之骄子，而是原本生活在接近赤贫中的农民们和ta们原本要在家里接着种地的子女们啊。", "char_start": 110, "char_end": 166}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "中国数亿农业人口、乡村人口，是从比996更辛苦、所得更少的状态提升到了996可供在城市里温饱的状态。", "char_start": 167, "char_end": 217}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "它只是现在渐趋饱和了，新增岗位没有之前那么频繁和密集了，资深的劳动者们因为现代职业对年龄体力的不敏感而大幅的延长了职业生涯，没有为年轻人们腾让出足够多的岗位，导致新岗位的供给跟不上，竞争更激烈了。", "char_start": 218, "char_end": 316}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但这并没有改变故事的主体——主体人群不是从金领坠落到了蓝领，而是从无领甚至赤膊好歹穿上了背心短袖。", "char_start": 317, "char_end": 366}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "甚至，要解决这个问题，要靠我们攻入更多的领域，制造出更多“至少有得996”的入门岗位来。", "char_start": 367, "char_end": 411}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "要一个又一个的攻城略地，直到“996的苦逼职位”过剩，就业人口供应不足，才会开始出现对996过劳现象的真正扭转。", "char_start": 412, "char_end": 468}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "换言之，是我们“白菜化”的范围还不够广、不够深，以至于我们没有足够多的“996职位”来先实现充分就业，然后基于充分就业来推升待遇飘升。", "char_start": 469, "char_end": 536}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "我们不但不是“白菜化”的行业太多，反而恰恰是“白菜化”的行业还太少。", "char_start": 537, "char_end": 571}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "在白菜化的过程中，我们是不折不扣的受益者，而不是受害者，事实上，我们应该庆幸时代把这些行业的“白菜化”使命交给了我们而不是其他人。", "char_start": 572, "char_end": 637}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "我们是十四亿人口的大国，正如某人所说的——我们如果过上西方式的生活，对世界是无法承受的灾难。", "char_start": 638, "char_end": 684}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "他自以为说的是吹空调，开汽车、吃牛排的生活，却没意识到那根本不是对“西方的生活”的本质概括。", "char_start": 685, "char_end": 731}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "事实上电不稀缺、汽车也不稀缺、牛排更不稀缺，全世界要过这种生活也没什么克服不了的资源限制。", "char_start": 732, "char_end": 777}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "我们所不能参加的那个“西方的生活”，是再给世界增加十几个亿以邻为壑的老爷，操起铁、火与电侵略和镇压，连一条不服务于掠夺的公路和电站也不肯修、故意将全世界的弱国们置于破产、愚昧之中，把白菜卖出肉价钱的那种生活。", "char_start": 778, "char_end": 882}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我们站在被掠夺的一方，用肉价钱去买ta们的白菜，ta们犹嫌自己过得不够快活，要是我们再加入ta们，用我们的白菜去卖ta们的肉价钱，不但减少十几亿上供的佃户，还要分ta们的祭肉，地球村这么点佃户，怎么供得起这许多老爷？", "char_start": 883, "char_end": 991}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "所谓的东升西降，到最后必然是以我们的白菜化进程把我们估值不到他们百分之一的企业翻寥寥几倍，然而却把对手近百倍于我们的估值刺破，打个一折的过程。", "char_start": 992, "char_end": 1063}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "泥巴做的兵马俑高举白菜拯救世界——为这美好的结局祈祷吧。", "char_start": 1064, "char_end": 1092}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这是人类命运最好的安排了。", "char_start": 1093, "char_end": 1106}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0589"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么只要是中国企业进入一个行业，就会搞得上下游产业链利润缩水，员工996 工资不涨，贫富差距拉大？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“白菜救世”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“因为老天爷不忍心世界上只有那么点人能穿得起鞋子、用得上空调、开的起车、用得起电、吃得起饭和药啊。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "因为老天爷不忍心世界上只有那么点人能穿得起鞋子、用得上空调、开的起车、用得起电、吃得起饭和药啊。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 48, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5c87b749-7339-5551-b7cb-5962dc6d017d", "source_ordinal": 4199, "reading_ordinal": 4148, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "天光一现", "published_at": "2026-08-12T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1946137560477831611/answer/2048169143770277209"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "不敢自称哲学家，但多少有一些记录思考的习惯。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "以我所见，这些“哲学书”的创作过程是作者进入心流之后的一种自然产物。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "人沉浸到主题中去了，全部的智识都被聚焦到了那个针尖大的议题的核心上。", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 92}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "神游天外而魂魄缠绕，文字表达根本不是审慎斟酌的基于什么伟大的框架建造出来的，而仅仅是表达本能神秘的调动一切资产，自动捕捉灵感流溢出来的。", "char_start": 93, "char_end": 161}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这根本不是一个先思考、后记录的过程，而是一个记录即思考，甚至记录先于思考的过程。", "char_start": 162, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "笔尖、气息甚至常常领先于大脑，落到纸上，刻到声纹中。这东西先成了形，哭出了声，你才认出这是你的孩子。", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "进入了这个天人交流之中的人，只会贪婪的聆听自己内心的轰鸣。什么节奏、精炼、布局、通俗……根本就不在已经沉浸在狂喜中的人的思考范围之内。", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "等你终于从这种享乐之中醒来，手捧着这一卷天赐，你是舍不得更改任何一处的。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 358}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "例如《祭侄文稿》，就是横圈竖点，泣不成声，那一片狼藉也是完美的。", "char_start": 359, "char_end": 391}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你甚至会觉得自己无权改动，就像你无权改动自己娩出的婴儿一样。", "char_start": 392, "char_end": 422}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "天生成如此，这就是天赐予人的样子。除了错字、病句、显而易见的缺漏需要像修补兔唇那样给予医治之外，其他的安排，我便为其父母，又何曾有权利修改呢？", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 494}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "何况有些创造，虽出自于我，却连我自己也是生了ta出来才认识ta。我倒要先把ta抚养大，等着ta学会说话，来告诉我ta从天上来要说的话。", "char_start": 495, "char_end": 562}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "我又岂敢随意的删改，修补呢？", "char_start": 563, "char_end": 577}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "我虽不是ta们，但只要一看那些文字，就知道这些文字一样是这样来的。", "char_start": 578, "char_end": 611}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "我舍不得、不敢，ta们也一样舍不得、不敢。", "char_start": 612, "char_end": 633}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "尽可能任其自然保留，这是一种你自然会产生的觉悟。", "char_start": 634, "char_end": 658}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这之后你尽可以再写反思、总结、阐释，但那降生的原物，只能任其自然保留。", "char_start": 659, "char_end": 694}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "事实上，即使是你自己回头去看，也会发现这些东西的美丽和力量远远超出了你自身的位格。", "char_start": 695, "char_end": 736}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "它虽借你而生，你却其实是它的仆人。", "char_start": 737, "char_end": 754}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "它要“啰嗦”，由不得你。", "char_start": 755, "char_end": 767}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 20}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0589"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么许多哲学书其实输出的观点用几句话就能说完，偏偏写那么多文字？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“天光一现”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“不敢自称哲学家，但多少有一些记录思考的习惯。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "不敢自称哲学家，但多少有一些记录思考的习惯。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a21a4111-5b40-5bbc-b0c9-8ba132a4e799", "source_ordinal": 4198, "reading_ordinal": 4149, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "含着", "published_at": "2026-08-13T12:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2046860767601997436/answer/2048377585017655867"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "其实车门夹手有一个终极补救手段，就是把密封条做厚、做软，而把钢板之间的缝隙留到超过指骨直径。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为归根到底车门闭合真正的接触面是在密封胶条和车身棱线之间，而密封胶条是一个柔性构件，是可以有机会“含”住指骨粗细的异物而不对其造成严重伤害的。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "而这些密封胶条越厚，越能给钢板之间留出更大的间隙，这个间隙大于指骨半径，只要不是手指扶着门框时故意大力摔门，都可以基本保证指骨的安全，有伤也只是皮外伤。", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 196}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但这问题在于会导致车身钢板之间的接缝看上去很大，大到“足可以伸一只手指进去”。", "char_start": 197, "char_end": 236}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "等车厂做完这全部用心良苦的设计，给用户的最后观感是“接缝这么大，看来质量不大行”。", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 278}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "先给一个大差评。", "char_start": 279, "char_end": 287}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这带来两个后果——", "char_start": 288, "char_end": 297}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "1）要在对方持有本能的负面态度的前提下解释清楚这奇怪设计的合理性，首先就是尝试在对方没有任何实践教训的情况前提下证明对方有判断错误。", "char_start": 298, "char_end": 364}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这几乎等于在宣告“我比你聪明”。", "char_start": 365, "char_end": 381}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "即使不算不可能，但显而易见也是一个极为艰巨的任务。", "char_start": 382, "char_end": 407}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "2）即使解释暂时为对方所接受，这类“以防万一”的措施也会在“万一”没发生之前显得无事生非、小题大作，不断的在事实的受益人那里滋生负面评价。", "char_start": 408, "char_end": 477}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "吃力不讨好，花成本还得差评，在商言商，谁下得去这个手？", "char_start": 478, "char_end": 505}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "但这有一个例外——如果车厂长期引领产业发展，多次证明自己的“新花样”确有实际收益，建立起了崇高的威望，就可以凭着这样的威望省去解释成本，甚至直接让消费者反过来视其为新启迪、新创见。", "char_start": 506, "char_end": 596}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "本来没这回事的，但因为产业王者提出来了，反而成为了焦点，成了区分“落后的老设计”和“更好的新东西”之间的直观特征。于是反而会反向的刺激其它厂商纷纷跟进。", "char_start": 597, "char_end": 673}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "最典型的案例，就是苹果的“刘海”头和“灵动岛”设计。如果不是苹果做，而是别的二线厂商做，这个刘海头恐怕要被骂翻天。", "char_start": 674, "char_end": 731}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "有没有发现这背后的启示？", "char_start": 732, "char_end": 744}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "要解决一个隐患，光是发现它、给出方案还不够。要么你就要等待对方先遭受教训，意识到这隐患不只是隐患，还是真正的威胁；要么你就要靠长期谨慎积累的威望和信赖，来克服主动干预隐患的那两个天然的困难。", "char_start": 745, "char_end": 840}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "要是这两条都没有，你就要想好——", "char_start": 841, "char_end": 857}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "要么就只能自己默默承担一切成本和误解，甚至还要赔礼道歉、恳请对方看在别的贡献的份上给予耐心和包涵，先把这门槛翻过去，把保护措施建立起来，等待将来也许哪一天真的发生危险或者ta亲眼目睹别人发生危险，领悟到你这牺牲的可贵；", "char_start": 858, "char_end": 967}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "要么就只能视为天意还不支持现在将这个问题提上议程，你就坦然的把这心结放下，将来就算发生了什么，也安心的将此归结于天意安排——因为你当时没有勇气和条件做那个任劳任怨的选择，而老天也没赐予对方应有的际遇来降低你的门槛，这双重的安排，本身就是鲜明的天意。", "char_start": 968, "char_end": 1092}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "其实我们现在说的是车门夹手的应对措施吗？", "char_start": 1094, "char_end": 1114}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "不，我们在说一个通用的原则。", "char_start": 1115, "char_end": 1129}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "就如父母关爱子女，想提示子女要养成某某意识以防范某某子女尚未遇到也没见过的风险，却忘了虽然你精心设计了方法、提供了工具，但学习这方法、应用这工具的代价最终要由子女支付。实际会发生的，绝不是“你是出于好心、也付出了劳动和心血来构造方法，子女理应接手后续成本并表示感激”这样的天经地义。", "char_start": 1130, "char_end": 1271}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "因为如果这是合乎自然规律、会被人性奖励的，那么我们现在就应该会看到大到夹不了手的车身拼缝、会看到很多早该被满足的服务成为现实。", "char_start": 1272, "char_end": 1335}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "既然这些东西在现实中普遍难产，就说明自然法并不支持这种“理应自行接手后续成本并表示感激”的预期。", "char_start": 1336, "char_end": 1384}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "自然法不支持这预期，你要做，就要老老实实的接受“既要花心血思考，还要支付对方的应用成本，并很长时间（甚至永远）都不会被感谢”的安排。", "char_start": 1385, "char_end": 1451}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这安排是自然法对想要不等它发令就抢跑的人的天然限制，不能被归因为“子女/下属/朋友不识好歹”。", "char_start": 1452, "char_end": 1499}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "要么不做，要么心甘情愿地领受，并意识到这不是对方对你的辜负，而是你坚持要抢跑自愿甘付的代价。", "char_start": 1500, "char_end": 1546}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你站稳这个立场，咬牙坚持，绝不为自己抢跑的决断迁怒、怨恨你这奋力勉强所要服务的对方，你这份决绝本身，才会最终产生神奇的魔法——", "char_start": 1547, "char_end": 1610}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "对方不是为你的智慧有多高明、也不是为你提示的风险有多凶恶，而是为了你这不惜强咽一切也要建起这道防护墙的真诚，会真的愿意成全你的忧虑和服务。", "char_start": 1611, "char_end": 1680}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "是的，你是为ta担忧，是为ta操劳；是的，最终是ta得益。但只因你要抢在上天用灾难唤醒ta之前遮挡，你就必须独咽委屈，而且必须完全咽下去，无论如何不能抱怨ta。", "char_start": 1681, "char_end": 1761}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "如果天幸ta能在灾难降临前就认同你这付出的价值，将不会是因为感激你的担忧，你的操劳，你的智慧。", "char_start": 1762, "char_end": 1809}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "而会是因为你这份绝不抱怨的克制。", "char_start": 1810, "char_end": 1826}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "因为只有这克制——而不是那些担忧、操劳、智慧——才是爱。", "char_start": 1827, "char_end": 1855}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "这事原不可做，", "char_start": 1856, "char_end": 1863}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "除非你有这不抱怨的爱。", "char_start": 1864, "char_end": 1875}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 37}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0589"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：小米 SU7 电吸门夹伤女子致骨折，官方确认无防夹功能，汽车电吸门技术应如何平衡便利与安全？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036"], "summary": "围绕“含着”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“其实车门夹手有一个终极补救手段，就是把密封条做厚、做软，而把钢板之间的缝隙留到超过指骨直径。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "其实车门夹手有一个终极补救手段，就是把密封条做厚、做软，而把钢板之间的缝隙留到超过指骨直径。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 46, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "027ef4f3-f6ee-52b6-911d-021bb49a91fb", "source_ordinal": 4186, "reading_ordinal": 4150, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "文情", "published_at": "2026-08-13T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1957061060604437527/answer/2069957403857179757"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "鲁迅的可贵，其实首要的不在于他的那些文学作品，而在于他这个人。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "他对人民爱得深沉。", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "那些文字，不是为了展现才情、愉悦自我、争名获利而作。", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "字字句句，都是为了中国的青年、孩子。", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 87}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "为了那铁屋中沉睡的人们。", "char_start": 88, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "他没有一行字不是为了这目的而作的。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 118}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "他的文字写了人民的悲凉、痛苦和悲剧，然而却没有任何鄙视和厌弃。", "char_start": 119, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "他的文字里有不屈和义愤，从未因强暴当前而钳口不言。", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 176}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "他的一生作为，文学只是其中微不足道的一部分，只是因为这部分容易留存和传颂，所以让人觉得他似乎是个职业文学家罢了。", "char_start": 177, "char_end": 233}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "不是鲁迅因为这些文字而伟大，而是这些文字因为是鲁迅所写而珍贵。", "char_start": 234, "char_end": 265}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "没有这些文字，他也会是医生、是记者、是教师、是战士，仍然会用尽全部的心力、操起全部的可能，为我们燃烧他的一切。", "char_start": 266, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "横眉冷对千夫指，俯首甘为孺子牛。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 338}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "他是这么写的，也实实在在是这么做的。", "char_start": 339, "char_end": 357}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "写到死，做到死，真正的为我们燃烧到了最后一息。", "char_start": 358, "char_end": 381}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "写字的多，而动机如此纯粹的，大概只有托尔斯泰、陀斯妥耶夫斯基等寥寥几位。", "char_start": 382, "char_end": 418}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "文采其实是从爱中来的。", "char_start": 419, "char_end": 430}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "真情实感，计之深远，落到纸上都是人心。", "char_start": 431, "char_end": 450}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "其实哪有什么“文学”？", "char_start": 451, "char_end": 462}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "只一个情字而已。", "char_start": 463, "char_end": 471}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0589"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：鲁迅连个长篇都没有，可是为什么一提到中国现当代文学的TOP1，就都想到了他？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“文情”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“鲁迅的可贵，其实首要的不在于他的那些文学作品，而在于他这个人。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "鲁迅的可贵，其实首要的不在于他的那些文学作品，而在于他这个人。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "07cd5dcd-8e5e-5814-ab1b-983b04b8c553", "source_ordinal": 4197, "reading_ordinal": 4151, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "残而忍", "published_at": "2026-08-13T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1999474296825868647/answer/2048802461595465487"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "什么叫残忍？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "残，指以刀断肉。", "char_start": 7, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "忍，是心无波澜。", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "残忍残忍，有残有忍，乃为残忍。", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你不但拿刀杀伤对方，而且心里毫无波澜，觉得毫无愧疚亏欠，这才叫残忍。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 75}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "迫不得已有所杀伤，但没有心安理得——既然没有心安理得，自然就是有所克制、尽力回避了之后还是不得不杀伤——这就不叫残忍了。", "char_start": 76, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "本来故事到此结束，本座要宣布下课回家做饭了，你抓住袖子不给走——“那我觉得愧疚，也尽力避免了，但我还是觉得自己残忍，咋办？”", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 199}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "那你就停手，改吃素，接受只吃素的后果。", "char_start": 200, "char_end": 219}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "“那我要是接受不了只吃素，同时觉得残忍呢？”", "char_start": 220, "char_end": 242}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "那你就是虚伪。", "char_start": 243, "char_end": 250}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "“那我要是吃素，然后觉得你们吃肉的残忍呢？”", "char_start": 251, "char_end": 273}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "那你就拿刀来砍我们，然后内心毫无波澜。", "char_start": 274, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "“你们自己不觉得残忍吗？”", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 307}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "觉得啊，要不为什么下这么大力气争取当好人呢？", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 330}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "下课，回家做饭去了。", "char_start": 331, "char_end": 341}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "今天做红烧肉。", "char_start": 342, "char_end": 349}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 16}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0589"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：生物必须吃生物才能活着，这是否太过于残忍？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“残而忍”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“什么叫残忍？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "什么叫残忍？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
